      ":question/problem": "A grocery store sells cherries for $$4.00$ per pound and peaches for $$2.50$ per pound. A nearby farmers market sells cherries for $$5.00$ per pound and peaches for $$6.00$ per pound. A particular order of cherries and peaches would cost $$36.50$ at the grocery store or $$60.00$ at the farmers market.\n\nHow many pounds of peaches are in this order?"
